/arxiv.org/abs/2501.18585</a></strong></p><p>The researchers explore a phen=
omenon called "underthinking", where reasoning models frequently switch bet=
ween reasoning paths instead of fully focusing on exploring promising ones,=
 which lowers the problem solving accuracy.</p><p>To address this "underthi=
