03.04378">https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.04378</a></strong></p><p>Many techniqu=
es for scaling inference-time reasoning rely on tasks with verifiable answe=
rs (like math and code that can be checked), which makes them difficult to =
apply to open-ended tasks like writing and general problem-solving. </p><p>=
